<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Chrysler raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Chrysler raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating of Chrysler Corp on Tuesday to outperform from its prior rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- shares rose one to 33-3/4.</p>
</text>
